because I think it's not generally understood by the public that you can recover from or live a reasonable life with a serious mental illness such as schizophrenia. Again, going back to the LGBT world, I grew up in a time that I reluctantly say this, that gay people were looked at as sick perverts. And there's almost no educational way to challenge that. It's actually meeting gay, lesbians, bisexual people as peers.

